  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidation of Amazonian Identity of small scale farming families</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is the third phase of a process seeking to consolidate Amazonian identity of 40 campesino families in the municipality of Leguizamo-Putumayo through technical training, innovation and research of the demonstrative experimental processes, knowledge exchanges and other strategies and actions, which contribute to the care of Our Common Home and that promote the capacities of the campesinos, including women farmers, so that they are protagonists in the sustainability and conservation of the native products of the region.</narrative>
  </description>
